WEBVTT

00:17.250 --> 00:18.750
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.620 --> 00:20.380
OH! The time has come

00:18.160 --> 00:18.750
BUSTERZ!

00:20.380 --> 00:23.750
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.710 --> 00:24.170
OH OH OH!

00:23.750 --> 00:26.340
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.340 --> 00:30.970
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:30.970 --> 00:34.350
Of history

00:34.350 --> 00:37.730
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:13.220 --> 01:17.020
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by hwat fansubs

01:17.020 --> 01:18.560
The time has come

01:33.070 --> 01:37.660
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.660 --> 01:41.620
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.620 --> 01:48.550
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.550 --> 01:51.720
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.720 --> 01:56.800
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.800 --> 02:00.680
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.680 --> 02:04.940
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.940
And then...

02:06.940 --> 02:10.690
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.690 --> 02:13.150
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:13.150 --> 02:18.280
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.750
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.750 --> 02:27.670
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.670 --> 02:34.550
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.550 --> 02:40.140
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:45.310 --> 02:46.230
Hey!

02:46.230 --> 02:50.360
I'm Musashi-dono's number one underling, Ninjataro!

02:51.280 --> 02:56.450
While Musashi-dono's thrilling battle with the ayakashi was unfolding at Daitokuji,

02:56.450 --> 03:01.950
a super cute princess named Yumehime was being held captive in an old castle's prison cell,

03:01.950 --> 03:06.250
along with a young lord named Kobayakawa Hideaki.

03:06.960 --> 03:09.670
Yumehime has mysterious powers,

03:09.670 --> 03:13.210
and she's been seeing Musashi-dono's adventures in her dreams,

03:13.210 --> 03:14.970
even though she's never met him.

03:15.760 --> 03:20.470
Then, under orders from the Toyotomi
shogunate's chief minister, Ishida Mitsunari,

03:20.470 --> 03:23.640
someone arrived to take Yumehime to Osaka Castle—

03:23.640 --> 03:26.730
a beautiful warrior named Sanada Yukimura.

03:27.730 --> 03:31.770
It really feels like history is revolving around Musashi-dono!

03:31.770 --> 03:34.400
I'm getting so excited!

03:45.710 --> 03:49.420
The Earth of Gun-ki

04:29.540 --> 04:32.960
How rude of you to shriek at the sight of me.

04:32.960 --> 04:36.130
P- Please, spare our lives!

04:36.670 --> 04:39.050
It seems like you have the wrong idea here.

04:39.050 --> 04:43.510
I'm not going to eat your organs or anything.

04:46.430 --> 04:49.270
As I've sold my soul to the ayakashi,

04:49.270 --> 04:52.520
I tend to gradually lose my humanity.

04:52.520 --> 04:58.490
So, from time to time, my body needs to absorb the <i>«extract»</i> of young ladies.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.450
<i>Extract</i>?

05:01.450 --> 05:03.320
A word from the foreigners.

05:10.120 --> 05:11.750
There's no need to worry.

05:11.750 --> 05:13.840
I will hold your hand and that is all.

06:03.840 --> 06:06.140
Yasha? It has been some time.

06:06.140 --> 06:10.890
Ryougen-sama, a good day to you.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.440
Where have you been?

06:13.440 --> 06:18.110
I was observing the strength of
the gun-dou whelp we met previously.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.690
Oh?

06:19.690 --> 06:21.740
Then I take it you've dealt with him?

06:21.990 --> 06:23.150
Well...

06:23.150 --> 06:25.070
You mean to say you failed?

06:25.070 --> 06:26.530
My deepest apologies.

06:27.160 --> 06:30.120
Is he strong, that Musashi brat?

06:30.450 --> 06:32.790
Would you like to have a look for yourself?

06:32.790 --> 06:37.500
Ah, well no, I will leave the handling of that problem to you, Yasha.

06:38.170 --> 06:42.760
Anyhow, what about the matter of my beautiful queen?

06:42.760 --> 06:44.930
What is happening with that?

06:44.930 --> 06:48.550
It will be done on the night of the next full moon.

06:48.550 --> 06:51.060
Do not fail me this time.

06:51.390 --> 06:53.390
There will be no mistakes.

06:53.390 --> 06:58.020
I have subordinates constantly watching her every move.

06:58.020 --> 07:00.400
Rest assured, it is certain.

07:09.870 --> 07:12.950
How many days are left until the full moon?

07:12.950 --> 07:14.870
Tonight is a new moon.

07:15.540 --> 07:18.540
So I must wait another half a month?

07:18.540 --> 07:20.500
What a long wait.

07:20.500 --> 07:22.760
It will not be long at all.

07:23.340 --> 07:27.260
Not long until you are wed to Princess Kaguya...

07:27.840 --> 07:31.850
...and not long until the destruction of the Toyotomi shogunate.

07:32.470 --> 07:34.520
I certainly hope so.

07:39.480 --> 07:43.480
What do you mean, I'll still become a demon in the end?

07:43.940 --> 07:48.910
To begin with, there exist two gun-ki as counterparts.

07:48.910 --> 07:51.990
You mentioned there were only two in the world, right.

07:53.410 --> 07:56.660
The one that Musashi-dono holds is the gun-ki, Sky.

07:56.660 --> 07:59.250
The other is the gun-ki, Earth.

07:59.250 --> 08:00.380
Earth and Sky...

08:01.040 --> 08:04.840
By using the two gun-ki together,

08:04.840 --> 08:08.840
one can control the power of the demons in them.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.340
Essentially...

08:10.340 --> 08:15.350
So with just one, the demonic power inside cannot be controlled...

08:15.350 --> 08:16.140
Then Musashi...!

08:16.350 --> 08:19.900
Yes, he will eventually become a demon.

08:20.400 --> 08:23.690
Musashi, it sounds like that gun is quite dangerous!

08:23.690 --> 08:25.990
If you want to return it to Master Takuan, now's the time!

08:27.320 --> 08:31.530
The power of just this one is insane, and there's another one out there...

08:32.120 --> 08:34.080
Hey, Master!

08:34.080 --> 08:38.660
If I used both together, the power would be even more amazing, right?

08:39.170 --> 08:40.670
I believe so.

08:41.540 --> 08:44.710
So where's the other one, the Earth Gun-ki?

08:45.250 --> 08:48.630
Could it be inside your right arm?

08:50.680 --> 08:52.970
You fool! This arm is my own!

08:53.680 --> 08:54.810
Then where is it?

08:56.140 --> 08:58.810
You don't listen to people at all, do you?

08:59.140 --> 09:01.020
I'm listening just fine.

09:01.020 --> 09:06.860
If I'm gonna become a demon using just this one, then I have to get the other one!

09:06.860 --> 09:08.360
Right?

09:09.030 --> 09:13.490
Master Takuan! Tell me, where's the other one?

09:13.490 --> 09:15.830
Well, I just don't know.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.080
Huh?

09:17.950 --> 09:21.540
If I knew, I'd have already found it.

09:21.540 --> 09:24.630
It was precisely because I couldn't find it,

09:24.630 --> 09:29.630
that I settled for sealing the Sky Gun-ki inside my arm.

09:32.890 --> 09:36.470
What the heck? Right when I was getting hyped.

09:36.470 --> 09:38.560
That's a disappointment.

09:39.060 --> 09:43.230
Takuan, why not give him a <i>«hint»</i>, at least?

09:44.060 --> 09:46.520
Dabinoji, you know something?

09:46.900 --> 09:49.110
What exactly is a <i>hint</i>?

09:49.570 --> 09:52.570
I suppose you could call it a clue.

09:53.280 --> 09:57.240
Dabinoji, do you actually believe what that man said?

09:57.830 --> 09:58.950
Yes, I do.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.580
What nonsense.

10:00.580 --> 10:03.000
It's up to Musashi to decide if it's nonsense or not.

10:03.000 --> 10:05.840
Augh, whatever, man!

10:05.840 --> 10:08.500
Hurry up and tell me that <i>clint</i> or <i>east</i> or whatever it was!

10:08.880 --> 10:13.720
There was once a man who took up that gun-ki you have now,

10:13.720 --> 10:16.850
who transformed into a demon because of it.

10:16.850 --> 10:22.640
And while he was halfway a demon,
halfway ceasing to be human, he said this...

11:02.350 --> 11:04.690
Now, this land is mine to rule!

11:07.900 --> 11:09.230
He's about to say more!

11:10.190 --> 11:12.610
Yes, I was the one who took your lord's life!

11:13.030 --> 11:15.280
You bastard, you betrayed us!

11:26.250 --> 11:30.210
As long as I hold the gun-ki, I am invincible!

11:30.920 --> 11:33.170
I will unite this land!

11:39.350 --> 11:40.800
I was too late?

11:40.800 --> 11:43.140
Hyuganokami-dono, what have you done!?

11:47.980 --> 11:49.560
Revenge for our lord!

11:49.560 --> 11:50.650
Prepare yourself!

12:01.950 --> 12:03.950
Die, all of you!

12:11.340 --> 12:13.300
Please, stop!

12:13.300 --> 12:15.210
If you let go of your heart and reason,

12:15.210 --> 12:19.470
the demon that dwells in the gun-ki will take over your soul!

12:24.350 --> 12:26.770
It already has.

12:26.770 --> 12:27.940
What?

12:38.150 --> 12:40.360
But there is nothing to worry about.

12:40.360 --> 12:43.490
The demon inside the gun spoke to me.

12:43.490 --> 12:47.870
If I wish to become human again, I must find the other gun-ki.

12:48.960 --> 12:52.750
If I find the Earth Gun-ki, I can become human again.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.130
Where is it?

12:59.590 --> 13:00.720
There.

13:01.010 --> 13:02.090
There?

13:14.820 --> 13:16.900
The demon told me.

13:16.900 --> 13:20.400
The gun-ki, Earth, is on the moon.

13:20.950 --> 13:21.950
Oh, my...

13:41.050 --> 13:42.550
The moon?

13:42.550 --> 13:43.720
Hm?

13:45.970 --> 13:47.100
Up there?

13:47.470 --> 13:49.430
Well, the moon's not out right now.

13:49.890 --> 13:52.850
Tonight is a new moon, invisible.

13:52.850 --> 13:54.190
Oh, okay.

13:54.190 --> 13:56.610
The Earth Gun-ki is on the moon...

13:57.270 --> 13:58.570
What does that mean?

14:00.530 --> 14:04.070
In the end, they are only senseless words from a man lost to the demons.

14:04.070 --> 14:05.530
Pay them no mind.

14:05.530 --> 14:06.990
But...

14:06.990 --> 14:08.580
Well, that's fine by me!

14:08.580 --> 14:11.370
Let's go for it! To the moon and back!

14:11.370 --> 14:12.870
How?

14:12.870 --> 14:16.000
I don't know, we could ask Kaguya-hime to get it for us?

14:16.000 --> 14:18.380
The princess of Osaka Castle?

14:18.380 --> 14:21.840
Come on, I mean the Kaguya-hime of the folktales, of course!

14:21.840 --> 14:24.510
There's no way that girl is princess of the moon.

14:24.510 --> 14:25.300
Hm?

14:25.300 --> 14:30.470
I would theorize that the "moon" he mentioned could be a secret code for something.

14:30.470 --> 14:33.560
It could refer to the name of a place, or a person.

14:33.560 --> 14:37.520
In any case, the Earth Gun-ki is sleeping somewhere out there!

14:37.520 --> 14:39.730
That much is certain.

14:40.150 --> 14:41.110
I see...

14:41.110 --> 14:44.700
So after that, what happened to the man who became a demon?

14:45.200 --> 14:46.740
Well...

14:59.630 --> 15:01.380
Where are you going?

15:01.380 --> 15:02.970
Isn't it obvious?

15:02.970 --> 15:03.920
To my master...

15:03.920 --> 15:09.010
To Nobunaga, to finish him off! With this gun-ki!

15:14.980 --> 15:17.520
Mitsuhide-dono!

15:43.880 --> 15:48.550
To my surprise, I found no trace of a body in the ashes.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.470
Not a single one.

15:50.470 --> 15:52.350
But instead...

16:14.910 --> 16:16.460
You will go no matter what?

16:16.460 --> 16:18.210
Of course!

16:18.210 --> 16:21.420
I gotta find this guy's partner.

16:22.590 --> 16:25.090
Because I don't wanna become a demon!

16:25.090 --> 16:29.340
Very well. I'm sure you would be the one person who could find it.

16:29.760 --> 16:32.300
Thank you for the help you've given us.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.600
Later!

16:43.820 --> 16:47.950
Dabinoji, I suppose things have turned out exactly as you imagined.

16:47.950 --> 16:50.360
What are you implying?

16:50.360 --> 16:52.700
You make it sound like I'm some kind of no-good schemer.

16:52.700 --> 16:54.240
Is that not the case?

16:57.200 --> 17:00.960
Please, do watch over them from the background.

17:00.960 --> 17:04.550
I could turn those words right back at you!

17:04.550 --> 17:10.220
The blame for some <i>«percentage»</i> of this <i>«trouble»</i> does go to <i>«you»</i>, after all!

17:10.220 --> 17:13.010
<i>Trouble</i>? <i>Percentage</i>?

17:13.010 --> 17:15.930
Don't try to distract me with strange words!

17:15.930 --> 17:17.640
In the first place, it was you—

17:17.640 --> 17:19.600
What? You wanna go?

17:19.600 --> 17:21.400
Sure, I'll take it!

17:44.420 --> 17:46.170
We're being followed.

17:46.170 --> 17:48.300
Just let her be, she'll give up someday.

17:48.300 --> 17:50.840
How long will that be?

17:51.090 --> 17:52.470
Musashi...

17:52.470 --> 17:55.220
I <i>will</i> have revenge for my father!

18:03.850 --> 18:05.190
Oh, it's you.

18:05.980 --> 18:07.610
Yo, Ninjasaburo!

18:08.070 --> 18:09.610
It's Ninja<i>taro</i>!

18:09.900 --> 18:12.780
You, where have you been all this time?

18:12.780 --> 18:16.740
I do believe I saw you at Daitokuji, but then you just disappeared.

18:16.740 --> 18:18.870
To be a ninja means to hide!

18:18.870 --> 18:20.790
So I stayed hidden for a little while!

18:21.200 --> 18:24.880
I mean, you just got scared of the ayakashi that were attacking us,

18:24.880 --> 18:27.920
and came back when the heat died down, didn't you?

18:27.920 --> 18:29.170
Twitch.

18:29.170 --> 18:31.920
Ninjajiro, I don't blame you for that.

18:31.920 --> 18:35.050
Why don't you quit being a ninja and find another job?

18:35.050 --> 18:36.680
It's <i>-taro</i>!

18:36.680 --> 18:39.640
And I'm Musashi's underling!

18:39.640 --> 18:42.640
I'll follow Musashi wherever he goes!

18:43.020 --> 18:43.980
Oh.

18:43.980 --> 18:47.440
Musashi-dono, ask me to do anything and I'll do it!

18:47.440 --> 18:52.400
I, Ninjataro, intend to get you
whatever secret information you need!

18:52.400 --> 18:56.110
Ah, in that case, I've got a little job I want you to do.

18:56.910 --> 19:00.700
Hey, are you sure about this?
Things could go bad if you leave it to him.

19:00.700 --> 19:04.000
It's fine, it's fine! It's nothing serious, anyway.

19:04.580 --> 19:05.750
Um...

19:05.750 --> 19:09.460
If you're going to talk that way, please, do it quieter.

19:09.460 --> 19:11.670
I can hear everything, you know.

19:13.090 --> 19:16.640
There's someone following us.

19:16.640 --> 19:18.100
Huh? Wh—

19:18.100 --> 19:19.890
No, don't turn your head!

19:20.220 --> 19:24.100
There's a monster out there that wants to kill me!

19:24.100 --> 19:28.480
You don't have to take it down,
but could you get around behind it?

19:28.480 --> 19:30.270
I'll do my best!

19:30.270 --> 19:35.360
If you finish this mission, I wouldn't mind officially making you my underling!

19:35.360 --> 19:36.780
Basically, this is a test!

19:40.200 --> 19:43.080
We're counting on you! We need to get back to Osaka, you see.

19:43.080 --> 19:46.160
I promise I'll pass this test!

19:46.160 --> 19:48.460
And I'll be Musashi-dono's official underling!

19:48.460 --> 19:50.090
We're counting on you!

19:50.090 --> 19:51.800
We've got high expectations.

19:55.670 --> 19:56.550
I...

19:56.550 --> 19:59.220
I'll try my best to live up to them!

20:06.140 --> 20:11.360
I, Musashi-dono's number-one underling,
Iga-school ninja Ninjataro, will fight this monster!

20:16.990 --> 20:18.110
A woman!

20:18.110 --> 20:19.320
A foreign one, too!

20:20.410 --> 20:22.990
Oh! Ninja! Utamaro! Geisha!

20:22.990 --> 20:23.990
Huh?

20:25.450 --> 20:29.460
This is the first time I've ever seen a real ninja in real ninja clothes!

20:29.460 --> 20:30.500
I'm so moved!

20:30.790 --> 20:32.590
Um...

20:32.590 --> 20:35.130
Hey! Do the Leaf Camouflage Technique!

20:35.130 --> 20:38.840
Um... Are you the one after Musashi-dono's life?

20:38.840 --> 20:42.550
Yes, but that's fine, do the Leaf Camouflage Tech!

20:42.930 --> 20:44.470
E- Eeeh?

20:49.600 --> 20:52.150
Did you not hear me? I said do it.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.900
I- I'll do it!

21:00.030 --> 21:01.620
Iga ninja skill!

21:01.620 --> 21:03.070
Leaf Camouflage!

21:10.670 --> 21:13.170
Oh! Miracle magic!

21:22.760 --> 21:23.890
You...

21:23.890 --> 21:27.140
You think you can fool me just because I'm a foreigner?

21:32.310 --> 21:34.520
I guess he wasn't much of a roadblock.

21:34.520 --> 21:36.650
Well, not bad, for him.

21:36.650 --> 21:38.780
Let's hurry on, then. Where to?

21:38.780 --> 21:40.900
For now, let's head east.

21:41.320 --> 21:42.610
Osaka?

21:42.610 --> 21:44.240
Nothing left to see here.

22:25.820 --> 22:27.950
Princess! This won't do! Princess!

22:28.620 --> 22:31.410
I'm tired of being stuck in the castle!

22:31.410 --> 22:33.790
I do want to get fresh air outside sometimes!

22:33.790 --> 22:37.420
But you can never know when the ayakashi will try to attack!

22:37.840 --> 22:38.960
Don't worry!

22:39.420 --> 22:43.630
Tonight is a new moon, when the ayakashi are the weakest!

22:43.630 --> 22:45.010
Yes, but...!

23:01.900 --> 23:03.490
You there, are you alright?

23:17.750 --> 23:19.210
An ayakashi!

23:33.270 --> 23:34.270
Oh?

23:34.270 --> 23:37.400
Princess Kaguya has made her move.

24:00.380 --> 24:03.090
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.090 --> 24:05.970
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.970 --> 24:11.300
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.300 --> 24:16.430
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.980 --> 24:23.110
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:23.110 --> 24:29.280
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.280 --> 24:34.620
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.620 --> 24:38.750
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.080 --> 24:51.470
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.470 --> 25:02.400
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.400 --> 25:05.150
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.150 --> 25:08.030
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:08.030 --> 25:13.660
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.660 --> 25:16.410
I'll bring out every part

25:16.410 --> 25:19.410
of your unchanging style

25:19.410 --> 25:24.710
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.710 --> 25:29.840
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:30.840 --> 25:33.720
Tokugawa Hidetada and Ishida Mitsunari?

25:33.720 --> 25:34.970
Who are these people?

25:34.970 --> 25:37.850
Aren't these way too many new characters?

25:38.770 --> 25:42.940
The next chapter: <i>The War-Torn World Returns</i>!
